  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d636b7e6-3afb-5c5c-82cb-142e16208772" activityNameId="6a5ab1e7-8bfd-5d55-a2cb-6c7d7606fa04" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, sewer system, GFRP pipe, SN 10000-20000, DN 600, profile 4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, sewer system, GFRP pipe, SN 10000-20000, DN 600, profile 4
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 12df8ea8-d1a2-4905-b5eb-47af90688b73
This process models deconstruction and end-of-life treatment for 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with GFRP (glass fibre reinforced plastic) pipe. SN 10000-20000, DN 600, profile 4 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for 1 meter of sewer system with GFRP pipe, DN 600, profile 4. The operation of similar types of building machines across different processes is aggregated to one process.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: DN 600, profile 4, SN 10000-20000, according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. GFRP pipe, ID 593-597 mm, outer diameter 617 mm, wall thickness 8-12 mm, 31-37 kg/m, 1650 kg/m³.  
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_12df8ea8-d1a2-4905-b5eb-47af90688b73.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
